    "describe_ch": "介紹光干涉原理，及如何將干涉技術運用於科學與工程的精密量測。",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides a basic introduction to the theoretical foundations of optical interferometry, and then develops this theme to the use of interferometric techniques for precision measurements in science and engineering.",
    "pre_subname": "OPT2002光學(二)、PHYS2002電磁學(二)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "OPT2002",
    "pre_sub_ename": "OPT2002 OPTICS (2)、PHYS2002 ELECTROMAGNETICS(2)",
